<!--
SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Vladislav Janeček
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

Moves the data of the DMG build into the App Store build's container the
first time a sandboxed copy starts (docs/plans/mac-app-store.md §6). Not in
any bundle yet: it moves, it does not copy, so a test bundle with it would
take the everyday app's mail store away from it. Whether a copy that
leaves the DMG's data in place is possible is open (§6); until then this
file stays out of make app.
-->
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>Move</key>
	<array>
		<string>${ApplicationSupport}/Malachi Mail</string>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
